{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('snapshot_campaign_test.go');s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('if allow[i] && c.appendOne(i) { work=true }','''// While snapshot work is held, earlier FIFO append work must still\n            // complete so genuine rejection replies can trigger snapshot fallback.\n            appendAllowed:=allow[i] || (i==2 && len(c.appendQ[i])>0 && c.appendQ[i][0].Snapshot==nil)\n            if appendAllowed && c.appendOne(i) { work=true }''');p.write_text(s)\nimport json\np=json.load(open('submission-snapshot-explore.json'))\np['rationale']='Repair the exploration scheduler: the first execution reached an actual optimistic append probe but held the append completion needed to release its rejection, so it never reached snapshot fallback.'\np['sources']=[]\np['feedback']={'ref_ids':['9a5cebc41e534ebab825feb8e52e1d62','S_send','S_replication_send','S_leader_ack','S_async_usage'],'answered':'Execution 9a5cebc41e534ebab825feb8e52e1d62 compiled and completed the producer prefix through index 7, then failed its construction prerequisite automatic snapshot path not reached. The observed reconnect probe was MsgApp with predecessor index 7. Leader progress had advanced Next optimistically during the partition. The receiver rejection is queued behind append completion, which the driver had disabled too broadly. This is an unreached prerequisite, not a campaign-barrier outcome.','remaining':['Execute the corrected FIFO schedule to determine whether actual rejection processing reaches snapshot fallback and the three campaign observation points.'],'understanding':'unchanged','rationale':'Permit pending non-snapshot append work at the follower until the snapshot message is at the FIFO head; retain the snapshot itself and all work behind it. This preserves the selected pending-snapshot inputs and comparison while enabling the actual producer path. Older